Package: manimstudio
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Abhishek <streakundertaker482@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: ffmpeg, libnss3, libgbm1, libxcb-cursor0
Recommends: texlive-latex-base, texlive-latex-extra, texlive-fonts-recommended, dvisvgm
Description: Manim Studio - visual editor for Manim animations
 A desktop GUI for creating mathematical animations with Manim. Provides
 panels for trigonometry, complex planes, linear algebra, geometry, bar
 charts, 3D surfaces, number lines, and a Python playground, rendered
 through a warm Manim worker for fast turnaround.
 .
 LaTeX (texlive + dvisvgm) is recommended for MathTex/Tex and coordinate
 labels and is pulled in by default; plain Text() animations work without
 it. Install with --no-install-recommends to skip LaTeX.
